{"seq":3,"slug":"price-intel-dashboard","title":"竞争力情报看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/price-intelligence-data/price-intel-dashboard","wordCount":2402,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"竞争力情报看板\">竞争力情报看板</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>看板的职责不是把数据画出来，而是<strong>把数据变成能触发动作的判断</strong>。价格情报里真正驱动决策的判断只有几类：我在这个类目的价格位置是偏高还是偏低、我的价格优势在扩大还是收窄、对手什么时候会发动价格战、哪些 SKU 的价格已经危险到该干预。每一个判断对应一组指标口径，口径错了，看板就会系统性地误导运营——比&quot;没有看板&quot;更糟。</p>\n<p>看板的设计要抵抗三个诱惑。<strong>指标堆砌</strong>：把所有能算的都放上去，结果没人看；应对方式是每类指标都绑定一个&quot;看到之后做什么&quot;。<strong>绝对数值崇拜</strong>：显示&quot;我的价格 19.99&quot;，但这个数字只有在与竞品分布、与自身历史比较后才有意义。<strong>实时性迷信</strong>：竞品价格本身是小时级甚至天级的信号，看板做到秒级刷新既无必要又浪费算力，还会放大噪声。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[price_daily 汇总] --&gt; B[价格位置指标]&#10;  A --&gt; C[价格优势指标]&#10;  A --&gt; D[对手行为指标]&#10;  E[ts-features 特征集] --&gt; B&#10;  E --&gt; C&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  B --&gt; F[类目价格带视图]&#10;  C --&gt; G[优势/劣势 SKU 排行]&#10;  D --&gt; H[价格战预警]&#10;  F --&gt; I[运营动作队列]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[规则引擎 / 人工干预]\">graph TD\n  A[price_daily 汇总] --&gt; B[价格位置指标]\n  A --&gt; C[价格优势指标]\n  A --&gt; D[对手行为指标]\n  E[ts-features 特征集] --&gt; B\n  E --&gt; C\n  E --&gt; D\n  B --&gt; F[类目价格带视图]\n  C --&gt; G[优势/劣势 SKU 排行]\n  D --&gt; H[价格战预警]\n  F --&gt; I[运营动作队列]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[规则引擎 / 人工干预]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标族</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>典型精度</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格位置</td>\n<td>我贵还是便宜、差多少</td>\n<td>SKU 级 + 类目聚合</td>\n<td>日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格优势</td>\n<td>我的相对位置在变好还是变差</td>\n<td>SKU 级</td>\n<td>日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对手行为</td>\n<td>谁在动、怎么动</td>\n<td>对手/组级</td>\n<td>日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格战预警</td>\n<td>是否进入集体降价</td>\n<td>类目级</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康度</td>\n<td>数据是否可信、覆盖是否够</td>\n<td>管道级</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"价格位置指标\">价格位置指标</h2><h3 id=\"相对位置的定义\">相对位置的定义</h3><p>最基础的指标是&quot;我方价格相对于竞品组分布的百分位&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = F_{30d}\\!\\left(P_{mine}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{30d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是竞品组常规价在过去 30 天的经验分布函数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 表示我比 80% 的竞品报价便宜。这个定义比&quot;比最低价贵多少&quot;更稳健，因为它对单个极端报价不敏感——对手里有一个人挂 1 分钱引流价时，&quot;与最低价的差&quot;会给出耸人听闻的数字，而经验百分位几乎不动。</p>\n<p>百分位必须配一个<strong>绝对差距</strong>才有操作性：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 在 5 美元的品类里可能只差 30 美分，在 500 美元的品类里却是 100 美元。因此看板同时显示 <code>pct_rank</code> 与 <code>delta_vs_p50</code>（与中位数的绝对差），并用单位价（per unit）而非总价做比较，避免规格差异干扰——单位价口径来自 <a href=\"price-cleanse-anomaly\">价格清洗与异常/运费陷阱</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"价格带视图\">价格带视图</h3><p>对上层的类目负责人，需要的是&quot;价格带分布&quot;而不是单个 SKU：把类目内的竞品组按价格分位切成若干带（如 P0–P10 极低价带、P10–P50 低价带、P50–P90 高价带、P90+ 溢价带），统计我方 SKU 落在各带的数量与销售额权重。这张视图能回答&quot;我的产品组合整体偏贵还是偏便宜&quot;，是定价策略讨论的常用起点，也是区域定价与心理价位策略的输入之一——但本文的数据口径全部自包含，不依赖任何外部系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格优势与竞争动态\">价格优势与竞争动态</h2><h3 id=\"优势指标-不要只看单点\">优势指标：不要只看单点</h3><p>&quot;我现在比中位数便宜 5%&quot;是快照；&quot;我的优势在收窄&quot;才是趋势。优势指标因此要定义为<strong>相对位置的时序变化</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r = r_{t} - r_{t-30d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>同时用上 <a href=\"competitor-price-timeseries\">竞品价格时序与趋势</a> 的 <code>floor_price</code>（90 天最低常规价）构造一个更贴近实战的指标——<strong>距地板价的余量</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = \\frac{P_{mine} - P_{floor}}{P_{floor}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">oor</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">oor</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的含义是&quot;对手若再次击穿到自己 90 天最低价，我还要让多少利才能保住优势&quot;。它比百分位更直接地服务于 <a href=\"../repricing-rule-engine/repricing-rule-guardrail\">跟价规则与利润/品牌价护栏</a> 的参数设定，因为护栏里的价格下界往往就参考 <code>floor_price</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对手行为画像\">对手行为画像</h3><p>看板要区分&quot;对手在降价&quot;与&quot;对手只是调整了运费结构&quot;这两件完全不同的事。行为画像按组统计：改价频次（谁动得最勤）、降价与涨价的次数比、促销的深度与频率、以及价格变动的<strong>同步性</strong>——最后一项是一个值得警惕的指标。</p>\n<p>同步性指的是：同一类目内多个竞品在相近的时间窗口出现方向相同、幅度相近的价格变动。单次的情况可能只是巧合或对同一个成本冲击（原材料、汇率）的正常反应；高频出现则是价格战的特征，也可能触发第 4 章的合规审查。因此同步性指标是一个<strong>双用途指标</strong>：既驱动价格战预警，也驱动 <a href=\"../price-governance-anti/price-fixing-manipulation\">价格操纵/共谋风险防控</a> 的自动化检查。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>阈值示例</th>\n<th>触发动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>改价频次</td>\n<td>每周 segment 切换次数</td>\n<td>&gt; 10 次/周</td>\n<td>标记高活跃对手</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降价比</td>\n<td>降价段 / 全部变更段</td>\n<td>&gt; 0.7</td>\n<td>进入观察名单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促销频率</td>\n<td>30 天内事件段数</td>\n<td>&gt; 8</td>\n<td>促销战信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步性</td>\n<td>类目内同向变动对占比</td>\n<td>&gt; 0.6 且显著</td>\n<td>价格战/合规双检查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"价格战预警\">价格战预警</h2><h3 id=\"预警的形态定义\">预警的形态定义</h3><p>&quot;价格战&quot;没有统一定义，工程上必须给出可计算的形式。一个可用的定义是：类目层面在过去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 小时内（a）参与降价的竞品组占比超过阈值，（b）类目价格中位数相对 7 天前下降超过阈值，（c）降幅集中在少数几个价格带（说明是集中竞争而非普遍下移）。三个条件同时满足才报警，可以有效压掉单次促销造成的误报。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用控制图思路做预警\">用控制图思路做预警</h3><p>预警本质上是&quot;当前偏离基线到多少算异常&quot;。工程统计手册里的控制图思想直接可用：把&quot;类目价格中位数&quot;作为受控统计量，用历史数据估计中心线与控制限，超出即报警。相比固定阈值，控制图能自适应类目的正常波动水平——低价红海类目与高价小众类目的自然波动幅度差一个数量级。Prometheus 的告警实践里那条原则在这里同样成立：<strong>告警要少而可行动</strong>，页面上只保留需要人类响应的项，其余聚合到日报告（<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/practices/alerting/\">Prometheus alerting practices</a>）。价格战预警属于&quot;需要人类决策&quot;的那一类，因为它涉及预算与品牌定位，不宜全自动。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 类目价格战中位数控制图（EWMA 形式）&#10;LAMBDA = 0.2&#10;L = 3.0&#10;&#10;def ewma_alert(series, target, sigma):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;series: 按小时聚合的类目价格中位数；返回报警时点&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    z, alerts = target, []&#10;    for t, x in series:&#10;        z = LAMBDA * x + (1 - LAMBDA) * z&#10;        if abs(x - target) &gt; L * sigma / (2 - LAMBDA) ** 0.5:&#10;            alerts.append((t, x, z))&#10;    return alerts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 类目价格战中位数控制图（EWMA 形式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">LAMBDA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">L </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ewma_alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(series, target, sigma):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"series: 按小时聚合的类目价格中位数；返回报警时点\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z, alerts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target, []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t, x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAMBDA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAMBDA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> L </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAMBDA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            alerts.append((t, x, z))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alerts</span></span></code></pre></div><p>EWMA 用到了上一段是&quot;当前值 vs 基线&quot;，这一段是&quot;平滑后 vs 基线&quot;；两者互补：前者抓瞬时跳变，后者抓缓慢漂移。真实的价格战更接近后者——每天降 1%，一周后才发现已经晚了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据健康度-看板的前置条件\">数据健康度：看板的前置条件</h2><h3 id=\"必须显式暴露的可信度\">必须显式暴露的可信度</h3><p>一个不显示可信度的价格看板是危险的，因为它会让运营对噪声做出真实决策。看板顶部必须有健康度条：各渠道采集成功率、<code>trusted_price</code> 覆盖率、组平均置信度、<code>unit_unknown</code> 占比、以及每个类目的&quot;有足够观测的 SKU 占比&quot;。当健康度低于阈值时，相关指标应显示为不可用而不是显示旧值——显示旧值会让运营以为数据是新的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归因标注\">归因标注</h3><p>所有聚合指标都应该能下钻到&quot;由哪些竞品组构成&quot;。这是信任的前提：运营看到一个反直觉的数字时，第一反应应该是&quot;里面算了谁&quot;。下钻能力依赖 <a href=\"../competitor-product-match/competitor-catalog-normalize\">竞品目录归一与置信度</a> 的 <code>group_member</code> 证据表，以及每一条价格点的渠道来源（<a href=\"../competitor-product-match/price-scrape-compliance\">价格采集渠道与合规边界</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指标口径的版本化\">指标口径的版本化</h3><p>看板指标的口径会演进（百分位的窗口从 30 天改成 90 天、改价频次是否计入闪促）。<strong>口径变更必须版本化并留痕</strong>，否则运营会拿新旧口径的数字做对比得出错误结论。规则引擎侧同样要求版本一致——这是整个 hub 里反复出现的一条纪律：口径冻结。它在本 hub 的 <a href=\"../price-governance-anti/repricing-ops-monitor\">跟价运营审计与效果监控</a> 里被正式定义为审计要求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;dashboard_metrics&quot;: &quot;competitiveness-v3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;position&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;percentile_window&quot;: &quot;30d&quot;,&#10;    &quot;distribution&quot;: &quot;empirical_regular_only&quot;,&#10;    &quot;show_absolute_delta&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;compare_unit_price&quot;: true&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;war_alert&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;window_h&quot;: 48,&#10;    &quot;conditions&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;share_of_groups_cutting&quot;: 0.35,&#10;      &quot;median_drop_vs_7d&quot;: 0.04,&#10;      &quot;concentration_in_bands&quot;: 0.6&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;chart&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;ewma&quot;, &quot;lambda&quot;: 0.2, &quot;L&quot;: 3.0 }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;health_gate&quot;: { &quot;min_trusted_coverage&quot;: 0.8, &quot;show_stale_as&quot;: &quot;unavailable&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dashboard_metrics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"competitiveness-v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"position\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"percentile_window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"distribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"empirical_regular_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"show_absolute_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"compare_unit_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"war_alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"window_h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"share_of_groups_cutting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"median_drop_vs_7d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.04</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"concentration_in_bands\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"chart\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ewma\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lambda\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"L\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"health_gate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_trusted_coverage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"show_stale_as\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unavailable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与下游的接口\">与下游的接口</h2><p>看板不是终点而是分流器：价格位置与余量指标流向定价讨论与 <a href=\"../repricing-rule-engine/repricing-rule-guardrail\">跟价规则与利润/品牌价护栏</a> 的参数校准；价格战预警流向预算决策与 <a href=\"../repricing-rule-engine/buybox-win-competitiveness\">Buy Box 赢得率与价格竞争力</a> 的效果复核；同步性指标流向 <a href=\"../price-governance-anti/price-fixing-manipulation\">价格操纵/共谋风险防控</a>。看板自身不做任何自动改价——它是&quot;给人看的判断层&quot;，动作由规则引擎执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>看板的每个指标都必须绑定一个&quot;看到之后做什么&quot;，否则就是装饰。</li>\n<li>价格位置用经验百分位而非&quot;与最低价的差&quot;，因为前者对引流极值不敏感；同时给出绝对差距，并按单位价比较以消除规格干扰。</li>\n<li>优势用相对位置的变化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>）与距地板价余量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 刻画，后者直接服务护栏参数设定。</li>\n<li>对手行为画像包含改价频次、降价比、促销频率与同步性；同步性指标是价格战预警与反共谋检查的双用途指标。</li>\n<li>价格战预警用&quot;多条件同时满足&quot;压误报，并用 EWMA 控制图捕捉缓慢漂移；告警必须少而可行动。</li>\n<li>看板顶部必须暴露数据健康度，低可信时显示&quot;不可用&quot;而不是旧值；所有聚合可下钻到构成它的竞品组。</li>\n<li>指标口径必须版本化并留痕，且与规则引擎的口径版本保持一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"竞争力情报看板","id":"竞争力情报看板"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"价格位置指标","id":"价格位置指标"},{"level":3,"text":"相对位置的定义","id":"相对位置的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"价格带视图","id":"价格带视图"},{"level":2,"text":"价格优势与竞争动态","id":"价格优势与竞争动态"},{"level":3,"text":"优势指标：不要只看单点","id":"优势指标-不要只看单点"},{"level":3,"text":"对手行为画像","id":"对手行为画像"},{"level":2,"text":"价格战预警","id":"价格战预警"},{"level":3,"text":"预警的形态定义","id":"预警的形态定义"},{"level":3,"text":"用控制图思路做预警","id":"用控制图思路做预警"},{"level":2,"text":"数据健康度：看板的前置条件","id":"数据健康度-看板的前置条件"},{"level":3,"text":"必须显式暴露的可信度","id":"必须显式暴露的可信度"},{"level":3,"text":"归因标注","id":"归因标注"},{"level":3,"text":"指标口径的版本化","id":"指标口径的版本化"},{"level":2,"text":"与下游的接口","id":"与下游的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"竞品价格时序与趋势","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/price-intelligence-data/competitor-price-timeseries"},"next":{"title":"跟价规则与利润/品牌价护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/repricing-rule-engine/repricing-rule-guardrail"}}